  "notes": [
    "Receiver.setThreshold lowered the (diamond, 80094) threshold from 2 to 1; with 2, a single forged receiveData would only have been stored, not executed. Thresholds are HIGH config, so this sets the age.",
    "Campaign: every forged expressExecute on ReceiverAxelar on Ethereum, Arbitrum, Optimism, Base, Polygon, Mantle, Linea and Blast (BSC and Avalanche had none; Sonic and Gnosis lack ReceiverAxelar), by the main attacker and copycat bots.",
    "rEYWA (Arbitrum) has no price and was never sold, so it is valued at zero; 2CRV is valued at the pool's virtual price in dollars."
